{
  "id": "c1-e41-design-in-everyday-life",
  "level": "C1",
  "version": 1,
  "topic": "Design in everyday life",
  "parts": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "title": "Interview",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p1-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Good evening. First of all, we'd like to know a little about you.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e41-design-in-everyday-life/p1-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4400
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q1",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "text": "Candidate A, is there an object at home that you particularly like?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e41-design-in-everyday-life/p1-q1.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5000
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q2",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, how important is the appearance of things you buy?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e41-design-in-everyday-life/p1-q2.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4600
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q3",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "text": "Candidate A, do you prefer things that are simple or elaborate?",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e41-design-in-everyday-life/p1-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4800
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q4",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, what do you think makes a product well designed?",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e41-design-in-everyday-life/p1-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4300
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "title": "Long turn",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p2-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "In this part of the test, I'm going to give each of you three pictures. I'd like you to talk about two of them on your own for about a minute, and also to answer a question briefly about your partner's pictures.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e41-design-in-everyday-life/p2-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 13200
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-a",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "c1-e41-a1",
            "c1-e41-a2",
            "c1-e41-a3"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate A, your pictures show different attitudes to objects. Choose two of the pictures and say what the people might value in these objects, and how long the objects might last.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e41-design-in-everyday-life/p2-a.mp3",
          "audioMs": 11900
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-a-follow",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "text": "Candidate B, which of these objects would you rather own?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e41-design-in-everyday-life/p2-a-follow.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4300
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-b",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "c1-e41-b1",
            "c1-e41-b2",
            "c1-e41-b3"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate B, your pictures show how design affects how people live. Choose two of the pictures and say how the design might affect the people who use them, and what problems it could solve.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e41-design-in-everyday-life/p2-b.mp3",
          "audioMs": 12500
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-b-follow",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "text": "Candidate A, do you think good design matters in everyday life?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e41-design-in-everyday-life/p2-b-follow.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4900
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "title": "Collaborative task",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p3-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like you to talk about something together for about two minutes. Here are some qualities that a well-designed product might have, and a question for you to discuss.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e41-design-in-everyday-life/p3-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 10800
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-discuss",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 120,
          "diagram": "c1-e41-design-in-everyday-life",
          "text": "Talk to each other about this question: How might these qualities contribute to the success of a product?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e41-design-in-everyday-life/p3-discuss.mp3",
          "audioMs": 7100
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-decide",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "diagram": "c1-e41-design-in-everyday-life",
          "text": "Now you have about a minute to decide together. Which is the most important?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e41-design-in-everyday-life/p3-decide.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5400
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "title": "Discussion",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p4-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like to ask you some more questions about design and everyday objects.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e41-design-in-everyday-life/p4-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5600
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q1",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 50,
          "text": "To what extent is it acceptable for products to be designed to wear out quickly?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e41-design-in-everyday-life/p4-q1.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5700
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q2",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate A, do you think people care more about appearance than quality?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e41-design-in-everyday-life/p4-q2.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5000
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q3",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate B, should companies be forced to make products that can be repaired?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e41-design-in-everyday-life/p4-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5300
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q4",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 50,
          "text": "Can good design make a real difference to people's well-being?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e41-design-in-everyday-life/p4-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4300
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q5",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate A, has technology made products too complicated?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e41-design-in-everyday-life/p4-q5.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4800
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q6",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate B, are traditional crafts worth protecting in a modern economy?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e41-design-in-everyday-life/p4-q6.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5400
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
